  {
    super(typeCheckingVisitor);
  }

  @Override
  public boolean handleUnresolvedVariableExpression(final VariableExpression vexp)
  {
    return true;
  }

}

But, I get a nullpointer trying to reference them in my config setup.
I made a simple project on github to show the issues I am having:
https://github.com/karlhenselin/testGroovy
I appreciate any help you can provide.

